<title>BELGIUM: EU raises cane molasses import duty as prices fall.</title>
<headline>EU raises cane molasses import duty as prices fall.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee on Wednesday agreed to raise cane molasses import duties to 0.32 Ecus per 100 kg from last week's figure of 0.26 Ecus, an EU official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The increase is due to a fall in the reference price to 7.89 Ecus per 100 kg from 7.95 last week,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Duty on beet molasses remains at zero, with a reference price of 11.36 Ecus per 100 kg, up from 11.28 Ecus last week.</p>
<p>--Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
